### Contoh Kode Python (Data Cleaning & Visualization)
```python
import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

# Load data
data = pd.read_csv("dataset.csv")

# Clean missing values
data.fillna(data.mean(), inplace=True)

# Plot visualization
plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))
plt.scatter(data['feature_x'], data['feature_y'], alpha=0.5)
plt.title('Relationship Analysis', fontsize=14)
plt.xlabel('Feature X')
plt.ylabel('Feature Y')
plt.savefig('analysis_plot.png', dpi=300)
```

### Contoh Kode JavaScript (API Fetch dengan Async/Await)
```javascript
const fetchUserData = async (userId) => {
  try {
    const response = await fetch(`https://api.example.com/users/${userId}`);
    const data = await response.json();
    return data.profile;
  } catch (error) {
    console.error('API Error:', error);
    return null;
  }
};
```

